  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "With the new Enchanted Broom that has been added to VRChat, it is supposed to expire on November 1st. I believe a better system would be to turn it into a regular Sweeping Broom instead at that date, allowing it to \"Regain its magic\" once October hits again. The most recent VRChat 2026.3.3 Patchnotes video (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OXBIzslbEVk) the Enchanted Broom is described to be removed as so:\n\n\"The Enchanted Broom won't hold its power forever. It'll disappear after October ends!\"\n\nI feel like especially after recent community pushback from making another FOMO/Limited item, it would be amazing to pivot to \"Seasonal\" items!\n\nItems that change their purpose based on whatever season or event that matches its overall vibe, with the introduction of the Enchanted Broom, it would be amazing to see it become one of the first.",
